      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHIRL THE WHIRL (6) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in her fast 17.69 win at this track over 305m. Has the ability and looks hard to top. MOCAMBORA JACK (8) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fourth (17.73) in a TG1-4W at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Can find the frame this time. CADILLAC EXPRESS (2) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (18.12) at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Must be included in calculations. SLIPPERY GYPSY (4) is one of the chances after a minor prize at this track and distance last time.",
